# Change_Log_Project-CS2
Standards of Modular Coding Design: Creating a Change Log for the First Quarter Project# CHANGELOG

This file lists all the updates made to our Student Seating Arrangement System project.

---
## Version v1.0.0 - March 2026
- Initial release of the Student Seating Arrangement System.
- Key Features Implemented:
  - Main interactive console menu (Add, View, Edit, Search, Exit).
  - Array storage to track student names and assigned seats (1–30).
  - Seat assignment logic with checks to prevent overwriting occupied seats.
  - Input validation for seat numbers outside the 1–30 range.
  - Seat editing module: seat swapping and student removal.
  - Student search feature by name.
  - Seating layout display showing seat status ("Empty" or student name).
